<title>FINLAND: AKTIA BANK TO OPEN BRANCH OFFICE IN TAMPERE.</title>
<headline>AKTIA BANK TO OPEN BRANCH OFFICE IN TAMPERE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Aktia Bank said in a statement on Wednesday it will open a branch office in Tampere in the early part of 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;According to our view Tampere is a very significant growing market area ... there is room also for Aktia,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Aktia said it has currently 60 branch offices in Finland's bilingual coastal areas.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 248</p>
